---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { algorithmArticles, algorithmCategories, algorithmAuthor } from '../../data/algorithms';
import '../../styles/algorithms.css';
---
<PageLayout title="Algorithm — DreaMax 的算法笔记" description="DreaMax 的 CSDN 原创算法笔记：搜索与枚举、KMP、哈希、离散化、贪心、二分答案与动态规划。">
 <section class="algorithm-page" aria-labelledby="algorithm-heading">
  <div class="algorithm-masthead">
   <div><p class="expedition-kicker">PERSONAL NOTES / CSDN</p><h1 id="algorithm-heading">Algorithm<span>算法题解与笔记</span></h1><p class="algorithm-intro">我的 CSDN 原创算法文章，<br/>包括搜索、字符串、贪心、动态规划与模拟。</p></div>
   <aside class="algorithm-author"><span class="algorithm-volume">{String(algorithmArticles.length).padStart(2,'0')}<small>篇原创算法文章</small></span><a href={algorithmAuthor.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{algorithmAuthor.name}<span>CSDN ↗</span></a></aside>
  </div>
  <div class="algorithm-toolbar">
   <div class="algorithm-categories" aria-label="按算法主题筛选">{algorithmCategories.map((category,i)=><button type="button" data-algorithm-filter={category} aria-pressed={i===0}>{category}<span>{i===0 ? algorithmArticles.length : algorithmArticles.filter(a=>a.category===category).length}</span></button>)}</div>
   <div class="algorithm-controls"><label class="algorithm-search"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg><input type="search" data-algorithm-search aria-label="搜索我的算法文章" placeholder="搜索标题、题号或算法…"/></label><label class="algorithm-sort"><span class="sr-only">文章排序</span><select data-algorithm-sort aria-label="文章排序"><option value="newest">最近更新</option><option value="oldest">最早更新</option><option value="title">按标题排序</option></select></label></div>
  </div>
  <div class="algorithm-list-heading"><span data-algorithm-count aria-live="polite">{algorithmArticles.length} 篇文章</span><span>点击文章，在 CSDN 阅读完整题解与代码 ↗</span></div>
  <div class="algorithm-list" data-algorithm-list>
   {algorithmArticles.map((article,i)=><a id={`article-${article.id}`} class="algorithm-article" href={article.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-algorithm-article data-category={article.category} data-search={`${article.title} ${article.description} ${article.tags.join(' ')}`} data-updated={article.updated} data-title={article.title}>
    <div class="algorithm-article-meta"><span>/{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><time datetime={article.updated ?? undefined}>{article.updated?.replaceAll('-','.')}</time><small>更新</small></div>
    <div class="algorithm-article-content"><span class="algorithm-article-category">{article.category}</span><h2>{article.title}</h2><p>{article.description}</p><div class="algorithm-tags">{article.tags.map(tag=><span>{tag}</span>)}</div></div>
    <span class="algorithm-article-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
   </a>)}
  </div>
  <div class="algorithm-empty" data-algorithm-empty hidden><p>没有找到这篇笔记。</p><span>换一个题号或关键词，或者看看其他分类。</span><button type="button" data-algorithm-reset>显示全部文章 ↗</button></div>
  <div class="algorithm-end"><span>写下思路，也留下走过的弯路。</span><a href={algorithmAuthor.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">前往我的 CSDN ↗</a></div>
 </section>
 <script>
  import { initAlgorithmLibrary } from '../../scripts/algorithms';
  initAlgorithmLibrary();
 </script>
</PageLayout>
